### Baraat API — REST client file (VS Code "REST Client" extension / IntelliJ)
### Run seed first: pnpm db:seed  (all passwords: password123)

@base = http://localhost:4000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### ---------- AUTH ----------

### Login as admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@baraat.events", "password": "password123" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login as driver 1
# @name driverLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "driver1@baraat.events", "password": "password123" }

###
@driverToken = {{driverLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login as guest 1
# @name guestLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "guest1@example.com", "password": "guest123" }

###
@guestToken = {{guestLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{adminLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}" }

### ---------- ADMIN ----------

### Full operational overview (drivers + guests + pending requests + trips)
GET {{base}}/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Upcoming pre-assigned trips + unmatched guests
GET {{base}}/admin/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Onboard a new driver (manual — no self-registration)
POST {{base}}/drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Driver 9",
  "email": "driver9@baraat.events",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+91-9811111111",
  "vehicleNumber": "DL1RT1009",
  "seatCapacity": 6,
  "luggageCapacity": 8
}

### Register a guest (manual)
POST {{base}}/guests
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Late Guest",
  "email": "lateguest@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "pickupLat": 16.6647,
  "pickupLng": 74.2894,
  "pickupLabel": "Kolhapur Airport (Ujalaiwadi)",
  "groupSize": 2,
  "luggageCount": 2
}

### Manually correct a guest's travel details (walk-in / flight change)
PATCH {{base}}/guests/REPLACE_GUEST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flightTrainEta": "2026-07-30T18:30:00Z", "groupSize": 3 }

### Approve an on-demand ride request (manual human decision)
POST {{base}}/admin/requests/REPLACE_REQUEST_ID/decide
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "APPROVED" }

### Manual override — force-assign guest to driver (breakdown / VIP / no auto-match)
POST {{base}}/admin/override/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestId": "REPLACE_GUEST_ID",
  "driverId": "REPLACE_DRIVER_ID",
  "type": "ON_DEMAND",
  "destLat": 16.7093,
  "destLng": 74.2349,
  "destLabel": "Sayaji Hotel Kolhapur"
}

### Cancel a trip (vehicle breakdown) — guests re-queue
POST {{base}}/admin/override/cancel-trip/REPLACE_TRIP_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Flag priority guest
POST {{base}}/admin/override/priority/REPLACE_GUEST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "priority": true }

### ---------- DRIVER (role-scoped: only own data) ----------

### My profile
GET {{base}}/drivers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### My current trip (one at a time — no queue browsing)
GET {{base}}/drivers/me/trip
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Accept my trip
POST {{base}}/drivers/me/trip/REPLACE_TRIP_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACCEPTED" }

### Arrived at pickup
POST {{base}}/drivers/me/trip/REPLACE_TRIP_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ARRIVED_PICKUP" }

### Guest boarded
POST {{base}}/drivers/me/trip/REPLACE_TRIP_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "BOARDED" }

### Arrived at drop (auto-completes trip, updates break counter)
POST {{base}}/drivers/me/trip/REPLACE_TRIP_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ARRIVED_DROP" }

### Share live location
POST {{base}}/drivers/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lat": 16.7000, "lng": 74.2600 }

### Go online
POST {{base}}/drivers/me/presence
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "online": true }

### RBAC check — driver hitting admin endpoint must 403
GET {{base}}/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### ---------- GUEST ----------

### My pickup details
GET {{base}}/guests/me
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### My current ride (driver name, vehicle, live ETA — no browsing)
GET {{base}}/guests/me/ride
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Raise an on-demand ride request -> goes to admin for review
POST {{base}}/guests/me/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Landed early, need a pickup from T3 arrivals" }

### My requests (see "request pending" state)
GET {{base}}/guests/me/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
